Faster readme/licence lookups.

GetTextfile() results are cached, and only .txt/.md files are looked for
(no .gz/.xz). Opening Game Options probed hundreds of file names and took
seconds on an SD card.

For OpenTTD 14.1. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-openttd.

